WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:04.024
Unit twenty-five. Healthy Choices Review!

2
00:00:04.998 --> 00:00:08.738
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.788 --> 00:00:12.027
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.077 --> 00:00:16.062
Today we learn about Healthy Choices Review. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.886 --> 00:00:20.286
Choice. Say it with me. Choice!

6
00:00:23.777 --> 00:00:27.227
Healthy. Say it with me. Healthy!

7
00:00:30.713 --> 00:00:34.163
Habit. Say it with me. Habit!

8
00:00:37.668 --> 00:00:41.551
Nutrition. Say it with me. Nutrition!

9
00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:49.527
Exercise. Say it with me. Exercise!

10
00:00:53.023 --> 00:00:56.023
Sleep. Say it with me. Sleep!

11
00:00:59.524 --> 00:01:02.990
Safety. Say it with me. Safety!

12
00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:09.510
Goal. Say it with me. Goal!

13
00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:22.057
Every day I make choices about nutrition, exercise, sleep, and safety. Healthy choices become a habit. I set a goal and check my progress.

14
00:01:22.107 --> 00:01:23.433
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.758 --> 00:01:29.953
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.003 --> 00:01:31.153
Habit!

17
00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:37.293
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.343 --> 00:01:38.493
Safety!

19
00:01:39.595 --> 00:01:45.340
Did you know? Setting a small, clear goal makes it easier to change a habit!

20
00:01:45.390 --> 00:01:47.267
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:55.771
Think and answer. Which healthy choice are you most proud of?

22
00:01:55.821 --> 00:01:56.971
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.997 --> 00:02:07.021
Wonderful work, everyone! You finished Health Grade 4. Keep your healthy habits, and see you in Grade 5. Goodbye!

24
00:02:07.071 --> 00:02:10.430
Thank you, Nurse Bopha! See you in Grade 5!

